culuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS2bJCwRlsov9UBjGGszuNR_0Hyd1NElkENBnT14dbNRg&oe=6B0C6877"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Virry Safari 2: Feel the Wild", "keywords": ["animals", "video", "kids", "lion", "best"], "long_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!\n\n\u201cI have seen thousands of spherical videos, and the footage from Virry VR is the most stunning nature scenes I have ever seen in any medium. Seeing a big rhino, in its natural home, from the perspective of a mud puddle inches away, or having a lion literally lick my face to test if I am edible, were among the coolest things I have done in VR to date.\u201d\nJeremy Bailenson, Founding Director of The Virtual Human Interaction Lab, Stanford University.", "short_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virryapp.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/privacy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://virryapp.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/tos-vr.pdf", "publisher_name": "Fountain Digi